# Belt-and-suspenders: each subproject has its own .gitignore too.

# Secrets — anywhere in the tree
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!**/.env.example

# Node
**/node_modules/

# Hardhat / Foundry
**/cache/
**/artifacts/
**/coverage/
**/coverage.json
**/typechain-types/

# Logs / OS
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# X publish helper deps
scripts/x-publish/node_modules/
